{%- comment -%}
  Sticky black header: three mega menus, centred logo, CTA, cart/search,
  plus the mobile bar and slide-in drawer.

  Render this in layout/theme.liquid, directly after the announcement bar.
  The mega-menu and drawer link lists mirror the live store's navigation and
  are edited in this file — Shopify's navigation menus can't express the
  three-level, image-led structure the design uses.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
